    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like the struggle is actually worse than the failure itself. the shame is everything. i look at my family and i just feel like a burden, like a massive weight around their necks because i failed them so hard. if i wasn't here, at least the debt would stop and they wouldn't have to watch me drown every single day. it's just so much easier to just stop the pain, you know? to just... exit the situation.",
